Security status
---------------

This is a research/reference prototype, not audited production software.
The v1 homomorphic backend is SEAL BFV leveled HE, not TFHE bootstrapped FHE.
The v2 private orderflow layer is AES-GCM + Shamir threshold opening, not
audited threshold FHE. The mock chain adapters and mock threshold signer never
touch real funds. RPC adapters are integration scaffolds and require real vault
indexing, threshold signing, fee estimation, reorg handling, and operational
review.
